        "mission_intent": "Team, we need to strengthen our continuous monitoring program by integrating automated vulnerability assessment data from the National Vulnerability Database into our weekly security operations reporting workflow. As outlined in our ISCM framework aligned with SP 800-137, I'd like us to build a process where we pull standards-based vulnerability management data from NVD and cross-reference it against our current asset inventory to identify systems with unpatched or newly disclosed vulnerabilities. The reports should leverage SCAP-validated tools where possible and incorporate results from any OCIL-based manual checks we're conducting for controls that can't be assessed automatically. I want the output formatted so we can perform statistical analysis on trends over time \u2014 things like mean time to remediate, percentage of systems compliant with our security configuration baselines, and new vulnerability counts per reporting period. Please coordinate with the configuration management team to ensure we're pulling from the USGCB and any applicable configuration checklists as our benchmarks. I'd like an initial prototype of this reporting pipeline ready for review by end of next sprint. Let me know if you need additional resources or access to get this stood up.",
